        en: ['Not a single deer. But I did drink three flasks of red wine at 9am with guys in neon orange.', 'I shot at a moving bush. It was the wind. The bush survived.', 'Hunting day {w:weather}. I saw {w:animal}, it saw me, we both pretended nothing happened.', 'Six hours in a freezing blind. My only shot hit a "Hunting in progress" sign.', 'No game, but [[three|five|eight]] pâté sandwiches eaten with strangers singing {w:song}.'],
