        en: ['Weirdly, it worked: I wake up at 5am, drink lukewarm water and I\'m insufferable.', 'It worked: I get up at 5am for an hour of {w:activity}, and I talk about "growth" to everyone.', 'New routine: cold shower, gratitude journal and {w:food} for breakfast. People avoid me now.', 'Quarterly goals achieved. The only goal was to [[drink water|get up|make my bed]]. It counts.'],
